---
import BaseLayout from "../components/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Now — Erik Fryscok"
  description="What Erik Fryscok is focused on now: better engineering systems, practical AI-enabled development, guitar, and local cycling."
>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-3">Now</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2 leading-relaxed">
      A snapshot of what I’m focused on right now — the kind of update I’d share
      with a friend I hadn’t seen in a while.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-10">Last updated: August 7, 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Building better engineering systems</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          I’m focused on practical AI-enabled development, cloud infrastructure,
          documentation, and the engineering practices that help teams work more
          effectively. I’m especially interested in systems that make good work
          easier to repeat, explain, and improve.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Playing guitar again</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          I’ve been getting back into playing guitar regularly, with a focus on
          songs in Drop C tuning — including music by System of a Down and August
          Burns Red.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-3">Riding new routes</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          I’ve also been biking frequently, finding and creating new routes in
          and around my neighbourhood. It’s a good way to explore locally and
          make regular movement part of the week.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
